                                                "sense_id": "fe06f09d-7759-359c-9ba2-e039baf560d9",
                                                "text": "Yet from the late thirteenth century the metropolitan based himself either in Moscow or Vladimir-on-the-Kliazma, which was also in Muscovite territory, and it became the ambition of the Muscovites to make this arrangement permanent."
                                            }
